abstract: "Defines an AI Foundations implementation pathway that guides an organization from no integrated AI system to an organization-specific AI implementation design while preserving AI Foundations as the framework source, the operator as owner of the resulting implementation, and explicit boundaries around authority, provenance, state, control, and non-derivative use."

